  "question": {
    "text": "For an isomerisation reaction $A \\rightleftharpoons B$, the temperature dependence of equilibrium constant is given by\r\n$\\log _e K=4.0-\\frac{2000}{T}$\r\nThe value of $\\Delta S^{\\circ}$ at Hook is, therefore",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "W2sXR",
      "text": "\r\n$4 R$\r\n",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
