      "text": "\r\n$5 R$\r\n",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "rdc8Y",
      "text": "\r\n$400 R$\r\n",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "aoege",
      "text": "\r\n$2000 R$",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "van't Hoff equation giving variation of equilibrium constant, $K$ with temperature $T$ is\r\n$\\log _e K=-\\frac{\\Delta H^{\\circ}}{R T}+\\frac{\\Delta S^{\\circ}}{R}$\r\nGiven, $\\quad \\log _e K=-\\frac{2000}{T}+4.0$\r\n$\\therefore \\quad \\Delta S^{\\circ} / R=4 \\Rightarrow \\Delta S^{\\circ}=4 R$",
    "image": null
